            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Egi nju eryaba orubungo; omuntu weena oriba naarabaho aryatangaara, ayeshaanye, naagira ati: Beitu shi MUKAMA akatura ki egi nsi n'egi nju? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima bagira bati: Ahabw'okuba bakatsigaho MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo owaihire baishenkurubo omu nsi ya Misri, baayehongyera baaruhanga abandi, baabaramya, kandi baabaheereza; nikyo MUKAMA abareeteireho obubi obu bwona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
