        {
          "text": " (Faraho omugabe wa Misri akaba ainamukire, akwatsire Gezeri, kandi agyokize; aitsire Abanyakanaani abaabaire batwire omuri orwo rurembo; bwanyima yaagiha muhara we muka Sulemaani kuba enshagarirano; atyo Sulemaani yaayombeka busya Gezeri.) ",
