        {
          "text": " baijukuru baabo abaahonokireho omuri egyo nsi, abu Abaisraeli batarabaasize kucwekyerereza kimwe–abo nibo Sulemaani yaahindwire abahuuku b'okubakorera emirimo, bakaguma batyo n'okuhitsya hati. ",
