        {
          "text": " Kwonka Abaisraeli bo Sulemaani tarabahindwire bahuuku, kureka bakaba abasrukare, abandi baaba abatware be, abandi abakuru b'amahe, abandi abakuru b'engabo, abandi abakuru b'ebigaari bye, n'abandi baaba engabo ze ezirikugyendera aha mbaraasi.",
