              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemaani yaaguma naatambira MUKAMA ebitambo by'okwotsya, n'eby'okusiima ahabw'obusingye kashatu omu mwaka, naabitambira aha itabiro eri yaayombekyeire MUKAMA, kandi naayoterera obubaane omu maisho ga MUKAMA. Atyo Sulemaani yaaheza enju.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
