              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Hiraamu yaayohereza omuri ezo meeri abairu be, abarimbi abaabaire bamanyiire enyanja, kukwatanisa n'abairu ba Sulemaani; ",
